# Blast radius

`@` this when a small diff might break something the diff does not show.

Prove the one safety fact by running code, not by writing it up.

Ladder: said so → cited a path → walked the call → ran a command that would fail if the claim were false → reproduced the safe case.

Stop at the first rung that already holds. Do not write a report instead of a run.
